                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "29901978",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197994868319",
                            "num_reviews": 52,
                            "playtime_forever": 149,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 149,
                            "last_played": 1487003624
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A good slender-man type game and if a fan of that genre worth a pick up, if they have never been “your cup of tea” then not enough to add wider appeal in my opinion. Explore an island, uncover story through collectables with added twist of also having to collect items to survive. Multi-line story is achieved due to multiple characters you control but all characters personalities and characteristics are the same not adding much extra depth to gameplay through this dynamic. Game could of done with a slower start maybe explaining features like the map and hiding symbol on screen. But in all for the genre the game exists I feel its a good addition. Being under violent gore I would also call questionable (The game is much better at jump scaring them immersion scares from my experience)\n\nFull review: https://youtu.be/3aQRmjN70zk",
